This Low Poly Furniture Pack includes 3D models for making interiors in  various styles (e.g. sci-fi, loft). All of the them are UV-unwrapped & game ready (Basic materials can be applied in all modern game engines). I've made this asset for those who need the simpliest low poly models but don't want to waste time on making them. If you like this pack I'll expand it with new ones, good luck!
Separate models:

  - Lamp - 58 faces

  - Floor Lamp - 302 faces

  - Table - 160 faces

  - Sofa - 113 faces

  - Shelf - 16 faces

  - Chair - 114 faces

Total polycount: 1034‬ faces!
Other features:

  - Simplisity in everything;

  - All of the popular file formats (FBX, OBJ, DAE, BLEND,);

  - File names are easy to understand;

  - Extremely low polycount;

  - No plugins or whatever needed;

  - Easy modification;

  - You may use this simple pack in any purposes you wish.

If you have any questions/suggestions, please, write that in a comment section or contact me on my e-mail: andriyandriy1956@outlook.com

