Hi, friend!Here you can see an armchair model for interior visualisation. It is a High Quality game ready (Low Poly) asset which you can freely use in any (commercial/non-commercial) purposes without any additional fees. You can use it in a project of any type wheather it is a game/movie or visualisation.
Speaking about the polycount, it is quite a low number for a such a photorealistic asset.
Total polycount: 16k faces! 
SEPARATE MESHES:Just an armchair itself - 202 polygons.
TEXTURES:

  - Albedo/Diffuse - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Roughness/Detail Albedo - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Normal Map - 4K (4096 X 4096).

FEATURES:

  - Separate meshes, easy to animate;

  - All of the popular file formats (FBX, OBJ, DAE, BLEND, X3D);

  - File names (textures & meshes) are simple to understand, no mess in files;

  - Multi-style design;

  - Smart polycount;

  - Clean topology;

  - Realistic shading;

  - PBR texture maps;

  - Royalty-free licence.

ADVANTAGES BRIEFLY:Inteligent file naming, no mess in 3D file - no lamps/presentational planes/cameras/other trash. All meshes are centered by the world origin, has normal scale. No flipped normals.
RECOMMENDATION:To use all or the advantages of this pack, download my other assets (they are the same style and quality). You can get them from my artist's page for free or for a good price.
NOTE 1:it is important to note I am the only creator of all models in this pack and I ALLOW using them in any commercial and non-commercial purposes.
NOTE 2:If you have any questions/suggestions or issues with the asset, feel free to write me on my e-mail or use the comment section (or direct messaging).I am always ready to help you!
Best wishes,Your 3D artist,Andriy Bobchuk.

